From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Android: the folder buttons open the file manager, a Resume pill, the cheat file is fetched

The Open ... folder buttons did nothing on Android (a file:// link cannot be opened):
the activity now asks the file manager for the folder, or names it in a message. The
menu gets a Resume pill beside Paused, for touch. An Android app with no cheat file
fetches the profile's (cheats_download_base). latest_asset() also reports a file's
size and update stamp, so a check can tell a current file without downloading. The
menu text uses three periods: the CJK fallback font draws the ellipsis character
mid-line on Android. On Android the player is asked at start to move the game's data to the shared
folder (all files access, once) when it is in private storage, so every folder button can open it.
---
